# ── ULTRON V2 — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run, or holds secrets.
# A fresh clone with none of it boots straight to the setup screen.
#
# NOTE: git only treats "#" as a comment at the START of a line. A comment after
# a pattern on the same line becomes part of the pattern, and the file is then
# NOT ignored — so every comment below sits on its own line.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# Gemini API key, provider keys, per-plugin credentials, user name and settings
Config/ApiKeys.json
Config/*.json
!Config/__init__.py
# TLS private keys and certificates
Config/certs/
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
# A linked WhatsApp session: committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp account
Config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
*secret*.json
service_account*.json
# Environment files with keys
.env
.env.*
*.env
# Any other file named like it holds a key or password
*api_key*
*apikey*
*ApiKey*
*ApiKeys*
*password*
*.secret

# ── Personal data the assistant keeps about you ───────────────────────────────
# Long-term memory (facts about you, session summaries)
Brain/LongTerm.json
Brain/*.json
Brain/*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# Uploaded files
uploads/
# Call notes, transcripts and recordings
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
recordings/
call_notes*.json

# ── Downloaded models (large, re-downloaded on demand) ────────────────────────
Engines/Voices/
models/
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.bin

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
